This directory contains third-party libraries with their respective licenses.

The MIT text appears below twice, once for each copyright line here that needs its own,
and two more licenses are in the files beside this one:

    LICENSE-APACHE-2.0.txt    Apache License, Version 2.0
    LICENSE-MPL-2.0.txt       Mozilla Public License, Version 2.0

Those two cover DOMPurify, which mermaid.min.txt bundles. mermaid.min.txt carries
other MIT code as well, listed in the Mermaid section below, each piece with its own
notice intact in the file. All of these licenses permit redistribution. MIT and
Apache-2.0 are permissive; MPL-2.0 is copyleft at file level, and DOMPurify may be
taken under Apache-2.0 instead. See the DOMPurify section below.

